  M06 killed by test_older_text_stamped_assertion_does_not_join_newest_cohort
  M15 killed by test_check_evidence_lands_on_home_card_when_a_foreign_card_sorts_first
  M19 killed by test_fence_ignores_future_dated_receipt
  C10 killed by test_home_turning_foreign_during_check_writes_no_evidence
